  "body": "This is your opportunity to purchase a brand-new, contemporary home in Silverdale, offering four bedrooms, two bathrooms plus guest toilet, and internal access garaging, combining modern design with everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nDesigned with practicality in mind, the ground floor features a well-appointed kitchen that connects effortlessly to the open-plan dining and living area, creating a comfortable and social living environment. The layout flows naturally to the outdoor area, providing a private setting for entertaining or relaxing. A guest toilet on this level enhances convenience for both residents and visitors.\r\n\r\nThe upper level comprises four bedrooms, including a master bedroom complete with ensuite. The remaining bedrooms are serviced by a family bathroom, featuring a skylight that brings in natural light and adds to the overall sense of space.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* Brand new home\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms + guest toilet\r\n* Master with ensuite\r\n* Open-plan living and dining\r\n* Modern kitchen layout\r\n* Skylight in main bathroom\r\n* Internal access garage\r\n* Easy-care section\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet Silverdale location, you are just a short drive to motorway access, Silverdale Shopping Centre, and public transport links, ensuring convenience for commuting and daily living.\r\n\r\nClose to local schools and amenities, this property presents a strong option for first-home buyers, families, or investors seeking a low-maintenance asset.\r\n\r\nContact us today for further details or to arrange a private viewing.",
